{"availability":"available","full":"Deln0r/ygo","name":"ygo","description":"Officially listed, pure-Go port of the Yjs CRDT, byte-for-byte V1/V2 wire-compatible with yjs@13.6.31 (cross-language fixtures, both directions). UndoManager, snapshots, subdocuments, cursors, GC. yserve: single-binary Hocuspocus-compatible server with SQLite persistence and document versioning. iOS/Android via gomobile. No CGO.","category":"Other","language":"Go","stars":92,"forks":24,"created":"2026-05-15T08:53:03Z","updated":"2026-10-08T06:23:27Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ygo.deln0r.com","topics":["android","collaborative-editing","crdt","go","golang","gomobile","hocuspocus","ios","local-first","local-first-software","real-time","sync","websocket","yjs"],"demo":"https://ygo.deln0r.com/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:17.532Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:17.532Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:17.532Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T18:00:17.532Z","stars":92,"forks":24}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[]( []( []( []( [](LICENSE) [](go.mod) []( []( [](","Pure-Go port of Yjs, the CRDT framework for collaborative applications, officially listed in the Yjs documentation's ports page.","Ygo speaks the Yjs V1 and V2 wire formats byte-for-byte. JavaScript clients running yjs@13.x synchronize directly with Go servers and vice versa, with both directions verified through 218 cross-language fixture scenarios generated from yjs@13.6.33. The bundled WebSocket server is Hocuspocus-compatible. No CGO; gomobile bind produces an iOS xcframework and Android AAR (manually verified, not run in CI)."],"features":["Byte-for-byte wire compatibility, verified in both directions. 218 cross-language fixture scenarios (generated from yjs@13.6.33) cover the V1 and V2 update formats, snapshots, subdocuments, undo, observers, relative…","Pure Go, no CGO — mobile included. Cross-compiles freely to every Go target. The CRDT core, the sync client and the server also compile to js/wasm and wasip1/wasm; the one exception is the SQLite-backed store in…","Embeddable sync client, offline-first. The client package is a Go-native y-websocket/Hocuspocus provider: handshake, incremental updates, awareness, reconnect with backoff. With a LocalStore it persists the document to…","Complete CRDT type set. Map, Array, Text (rich-text formatting, Quill deltas, embeds), XML types, Awareness, UndoManager, Snapshots / time-travel, and Subdocuments.","Change observers. Map.Observe / Array.Observe / Text.Observe deliver Quill-style deltas of exactly what changed; ObserveDeep bubbles events from nested types with their path. Semantic parity with yjs's YMapEvent /…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Deln0r/ygo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d4286202d6e404e8911573988e789d9b099f0b6141d23d2d49c09cab3640a31d","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:17.643Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:17.643Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"[]( []( []( []( [](LICENSE) [](go.mod) []( []( [](","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Deln0r/ygo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"d4286202d6e404e8911573988e789d9b099f0b6141d23d2d49c09cab3640a31d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Deln0r/ygo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:17.644Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T06:23:27Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Deln0r/ygo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:17.645Z","hash":"d4286202d6e404e8911573988e789d9b099f0b6141d23d2d49c09cab3640a31d","originalBytes":33119,"storedBytes":33119,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["yjs","done","update","server","wire","ygo","sync","client","every","one","docs","document","sqlite","types","against","cross-language","internal","fixtures","reference","text","transaction","undo","updates","bytes","doc","format","gomobile","persistence","txn","block","edits",